"message": "Add isVideo and released to analysis; add unskip", "created_at": "2018-01-29T20:51:44Z", "repo": "ChinesePodAPI", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a1567ee10ea65907daae0feb55238bcb74079f3c", "message": "Properly set `isVideo`; add `released`", "created_at": "2018-01-29T20:16:45Z", "repo": "ChinesePodAPI", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0d97189098dc8aa7ce818b693cf4d120de2913cf", "message": "Swap order in 'Lesson'\n\nThis is a change to the binary format. I guess we'll just declare the 0.2\nformat to be under construction still :)", "created_at": "2018-01-28T18:36:48Z", "repo": "ChinesePodAPI", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3578c40b87ecc318bb64d08ab1d7cfc17744c7d0", "message": "Support migration.\n\nAnalysis now uses the V2 vocab API. openV1 can be used to load legacy V1 files.\n\nHowever, setting the `isVideo` field is not working correctly, I think because\nthe `lessonContentVideoLesson` field in the JSON content isn't actually set;\n`lessonContentVideo` might be a better candidate?\n\nAlso bump the version number.", "created_at": "2018-01-28T18:34:05Z", "repo": "ChinesePodAPI", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "31a5cf5fa42ad29777bd71ad50680b72c6b42e17", "message": "Improve vocab export\n\nWe skip fewer lessons now; in particular, we include lessons marked \"Any\" and\nvideo lessons (as well as some minor variations). This also changes the binary\nformat of the vocabulary however to include a boolean marking video lessons;\nhence, we need some migration code: right now the Analysis module still uses\nV1 of the vocab module.", "created_at": "2018-01-28T17:11:22Z", "repo": "ChinesePodAPI", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dacdc705e72d373b82785c1d38d35f04c9e428b1", "message": "Move to ghc 8.2, latest aeson, latest servant\n\nVer